**2. Implementation Path (How)**
*   **Step A:** Ground-based turbulence emulator. Use a hot-air turbulence generator and rotating phase plates to simulate r₀ = 10 cm conditions. Validate predictive AO loop.
    *   *Acceptance:* Strehl ratio > 0.7 maintained for 1 hour; SMF coupling > −10 dB, verified via **[X]**.
